        "startIndex": 7286,
        "endIndex": 7534,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Portions of the developer withdrawals occurred over the summer of 2026; the Bloomberg report synthesizes the full timeline, establishing the Virginia fight as a national blueprint for anti-data-center activism across the US"
      },
